WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:10.450
Sev Usal is one of Gujarat's most loved and iconic
street foods, with a special connection to the
vibrant city of Vadodara (Baroda).

00:00:48.097 --> 00:01:00.097
Born from the rich traditions of Gujarati street-food
culture, this delicious dish brings together perfectly
cooked white peas, aromatic spices, crispy sev, fresh
onions, coriander and tangy, sweet and spicy chutneys.

00:01:36.195 --> 00:01:43.465
Traditionally served with warm, buttered pav, every bite
offers a beautiful combination of flavours and textures.

00:02:24.293 --> 00:02:30.655
Over the years, Sev Usal has become more than
just a popular street-food dish.

00:03:12.390 --> 00:03:19.210
It represents the memories of childhood, college days,
family outings and evenings spent with friends.

00:04:00.488 --> 00:04:10.488
For people from Gujarat, especially those who have grown
up in Vadodara, its taste brings a special feeling of
home and nostalgia.

00:04:48.585 --> 00:04:58.135
Today, its popularity continues to reach beyond Gujarat,
introducing people around the world to the authentic
flavours of Gujarati street food.

00:05:36.683 --> 00:05:48.503
Sev Usal is not just food; it is a taste of tradition,
a celebration of culture and a little piece of
Gujarat served on every plate.
